sights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a breathtaking, single-contiguous collage full of secret hidden spaces within a non-linear, unlockable map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/246741e84b4736c837ff32322de45f14.avif?t=1770687950\" width=1560 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/175b52cc34666a259d73f170fbde1475.avif?t=1770687950\" width=1560 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Streamers have our permission to broadcast the Little Ghost music &amp; podcasts on their streams and playthrus.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","developers":["Alan Abbadessa","Law Jun Yan","Eduardo Alexandrino","Leaf Riifuneko"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/7fce3cad584ef2e555a070e6d78df0922202619a/header.jpg?t=1770687950","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Game Design/Build and Art Direction by Alan Abbadessa<br />\r\nProgramming by Law Jun Yan<br />\r\nTarot Cards illustrated by Eduardo Alexandrino   with Taki Kishala<br />\r\nLittle Ghost character originally drawn by Leaf @Riifuneko<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStreamers have our permission to broadcast the Little Ghost music & podcasts on their streams and playthrus.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1587380/1702653649/c6754dfdf3811373f043e66fdb9798e359716fca/1769577440/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769