ation &amp; puzzle-platforming. Frequent checkpoints, no currency, no combat. Gain friends &amp; abilities. Collectables-as-media; tarot cards, weird podcasts, and songs from over 20 bands; all found within a surreal papercraft world.","steam_appid":1587380,"support_info":{"email":"thesyncbook@gmail.com","url":"https://www.little-ghost.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.little-ghost.com"}